    // ── Non-ore signatures ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    // They also multiply (N x base) and can add to ore signatures in mixed clusters.
    // kind: "AsteroidType" | "FpsDeposit" | "RocDeposit" | "Salvage"
    // contexts: where the signal can appear ("Space" / "Surface"); empty = anywhere.
    // Sources (user research, 4.10/4.10.1): Prospector Index/UEX, STARVEIN, SCMINER, SC Wiki API.

